                    <img
                        src="{{ 'perfect-img.png' | file_url }}"
                        alt="{{ shop.name }}"
                        fetchpriority="low"
                        decoding="async"
                        width="697"
                        height="638"
                        loading="lazy"
                    >
                </picture>
            </div>
            <div class="perfect__text">
                <h2 class="perfect__title title">THE PERFECT DOSE</h2>
                <p class="perfect__descr">
                    The amount and type of each ingredient make all the difference in getting the results you want. Our products are formulated with clinically-tested actives. These are ingredients that we include in the exact amount that have shown efficacy in gold standard clinical trials in humans.
